    "created_at": "2024-02-09T12:25:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-02-09T12:25:42Z",
    "body": "The `textInput` event is required for web compat when typing, pasting, dropping, and maybe some other actions, in an editable field (`input` or `textarea` or `contenteditable`). The event uses the `TextEvent` interface in Chromium and WebKit. Supporting that interface and the change in this PR is also required for web compat because some sites use it for feature-checking support for the `textInput` event. Example: https://github.com/cespare/pastedown/blob/9211a49c848d037b01fd42c26891f4b83a19a56d/public/pastedown.js#L51",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
